# of each input and entry, by group, case and input. Not a limit: stage 3 optimizations move the totals.
# A run checks every entry of its scope: an entry that is missing, stale or different fails. -update replaces the
# entries of the scope, drops stale ones and logs a summary per case. Review the diff: it is a regression freeze.
